Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 04:16:04 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] drm/bridge: lontium: update LT9611C/EX/UXD DSI to HDMI bridge driver

Update the in-tree Lontium LT9611C/EX/UXD bridge driver with the
board-required command handling, EDID, HPD, and audio infoframe support.

Signed-off-by: Mohit Dsor <mohit.dsor@oss.qualcomm.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
